# Cubase harness projects ("<name> harness/"): commit the .cpr and the small Misc parts (.smt, .xml).
# Everything below is rebuilt or per machine.

# harness-input.wav: rebuilt by  python make_cubase_harness.py parts
*/Audio/
*/Misc/*.wav
# Cubase's waveform caches, exports, backups
*/Images/
*.peak
*/Mixdown/
*/Auto Saves/
*.bak
*.csh
*/Track Pictures/
# run logs, screenshots and renders from run_cubase_harness.ps1
*/Runs/
# goldens are per machine and live outside the repo: %USERPROFILE%\.wla-test\goldens\<name>\cubase\
*/Golden/

__pycache__/
